# arm: middle
# half verbatim; freer joinery, no restyling
# created 2026-08-13. Deltas from the base; everything unlisted falls through.
#
# Runs every day beside the base, into sync/Obsidian/Posts/middle/.
# bin/arm.sh promote middle folds these into profiles/base.env.

# Its own copy of the curator prompt, saying "freer joinery, no restyling" in the
# paragraph that otherwise counsels restraint. It used to be a directive that
# opened by announcing the base prompt's rule was lifted; leaving the directive
# slot free means this arm now inherits the base's propose-generously.md, which
# the directive had been silently displacing.
PROMPTS_DIR=$BLOG_REPO_DIR/profiles/overlays/middle
VERBATIM_MIN=55
NEW_SLACK_EVERY=6
GLUE_MAX_WORDS=20
GATE_TRACE=1
# quotas deliberately absent: inherited from the base, so the only thing
# this arm changes is how it writes.
